This skill is a `skills/*` workspace, so its `bun test` units + `tsc` typecheck
run with the repo gate. TypeScript skills use **bun test** (they are Bun-native);
keep the runtime entry self-contained (only `node:*` / `bun` builtins) so it runs
wherever the skill is installed.

## Develop

```bash
bun install                                          # from the repo root
bun run --filter @tale/{{kebabCase name}} test       # bun test
bun run --filter @tale/{{kebabCase name}} typecheck
```

## Run

```bash
bun scripts/main.ts [name]
```

See [`SKILL.md`](SKILL.md) for the agent-facing guidance. A `skills/*` workspace is
baked into the `services/sandbox-runtime` image — see `AGENTS.md` (the skills section).
